# Next.js Patterns

## Route groups
- `(public)/` — marketing pages
- `(admin)/`, `(partner)/` — portal placeholders
- `api/` — bot, LINE webhook, analytics, health

## Conventions
- Server Components default; `'use client'` only when needed
- Metadata in `layout.tsx` / page — site still `robots: noindex` until launch
- `lang="th"` on `<html>`
- Constants from `@/lib/constants/site`, content from `@/content/*`

## Do not
- Wire to real CRM/trading portal/payment/KYC
- Break stable route paths documented in README

## Verify after changes
```bash
npm run typecheck
npm run lint
npm run build
```
